  "description": "\"It’s called Yoo Se-jin.\" Lee Yeon disguises her status as a student at a prestigious university and works part-time as an extracurricular student. One day, he discovers that the new student he is going to teach is Seo Do-young, who has been bullying him at school. \"Lee Yeon, are you good at acting?\" Seo Do-young had a grudge against Lee-yeon, who is cold for the woman she likes, and uses her weakness to encourage her to continue tutoring in order to avoid studying abroad. But... \"Can I solve the curiosity you mentioned?\" Lee Yeon is indifferent both at home and at school.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**       \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/65749301), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/2968007958), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12004595), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/wetseason), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/rainy_season), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000067111) \n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003755)",
